BSIM3 unified flicker noise versus NOIC
* Provenance: original Sansho black-box experiment for ngspice 44.2.
* sweep: 0 2e-13 2e-12 2e-11
.param probe=2e-13
Vgate g 0 DC 1.05 AC 1
Vdrain d 0 1.7
Hread out 0 Vdrain 1k
M1 d g 0 0 nch L=0.65u W=2.8u
.model nch nmos level=8 version=3.3 tox=8n xj=0.13u nch=2.1e17
+ vth0=0.54 k1=0.52 k2=-0.023 u0=460 vsat=92000 rdsw=85 pclm=1.15
+ lint=9n wint=15n mobmod=2 a0=1.15 pdiblc2=0.013 tnom=27
+ noimod=2 ef=1 noia=8e19 noib=3e4 noic={probe} em=4.1e7
.noise v(out) Vgate dec 4 1 100meg
.end
